# Development artifacts (should not be in repo)
package-lock.json
uv.lock

# Skill eval workspaces must live in .dev/eval-workspaces/ -- see .dev/README.md
.claude/skills/*-workspace/

# Defensive guards added by TASK-RF-20260518-181333 (repo cleanup pre PR split)
# Version-string typo guard: prevents shell-redirect typos like `> 0.20` from
# committing a 0-byte file at repo root. Anchored to repo root only.
/0.[0-9]*
# PRD-skill CWD-default escape: PRD dry-run output dirs created at repo root
# rather than in the expected .dev/ workspace. Anchored to repo root so that
# legitimate uses inside .dev/eval-workspaces/ remain tracked. Source-code
# fix is a follow-up task.
/prd-*-test/
/prd-test-*/
/prd-dry-run-*/
# Eval-runs workspace (research/eval scratch).
.dev/eval-runs/
# Git worktrees — canonical location is .dev/worktrees/<name>/ (never .claude/worktrees/).
# Nested worktree checkouts must never be staged.
.dev/worktrees/
# Sprint runner transient exitcode marker. Anchored to repo root only so that
# in-tree archive/release artifacts under .dev/releases/ remain tracked.
/.sprint-exitcode
# sc:pr-submit operator-local run-logs + the probe-locked detection contract.
# The shipped src/.../detection-contract.md stays locked:false (generic, distributable);
# the operator's REAL locked contract + write-ahead run-logs are fork-specific and
# NEVER tracked. (See sc-pr-submit-protocol; arm path = DetectionContract.for_arming().)
.dev/pr-monitor/

# Sprint runner transient state directory (post-FU-001 default). Holds
# .sprint-exitcode and other ephemeral per-run state; never tracked.
.dev/sprint-state/
# e2e-reflect harness sprint-state (same ephemeral exitcode/state, nested
# under per-scenario test dirs). FU-001 forbids tracking .sprint-exitcode.
.dev/e2e-reflect/**/sprint-state/
# Sprint runner per-task stdout/stderr dumps. Routinely exceed the 1 MB
# pre-commit large-file threshold; the manifest, execution-log, tasklists,
# and verification artifacts in the same release directory remain tracked.
.dev/releases/**/results/phase-*-task-*-output.txt
# Reflect run raw stream artifacts under task folders: bulky JSONL stdout and
# raw stderr logs that routinely exceed the 1 MB pre-commit large-file threshold
# and fail single-document check-json. The REPORT.md / return-contract.yaml /
# audit.log / reviewer-cards in the same reflect dir remain tracked.
.dev/tasks/**/reflect/**/reflect-stdout.json
.dev/tasks/**/reflect/**/reflect-stderr.log
.dev/tasks/**/reflect/**/fix-*-stdout.json
.dev/tasks/**/reflect/**/fix-*-stderr.log
